text:
hax-schema documents the schema hax uses to interface with a web component implementing it. components haxproperties describe how it appears in gizmo browser, what settings editor shows for it, and should treat during editing. is typically defined standalone json file, referenced from element via static getter:
static get haxproperties() {
  return new url('./lib/block-quote.haxproperties.json', import.meta.url).href;
}
see example.json complete example derived block-quote element.

save options ensure built-in clean up happens when the element is converted to an html string. wipeslot removes any light dom content might have. unsetattributes array of strings which will be removed prior saving string.
"saveoptions": {
  "wipeslot": false,
 "unsetattributes": []
}
